The '''Royal Quarters''' is a large area in the back of the {{Zone|Royal Palace}}.

== Purpose ==
The {{NPCSprite|Royal Residents}} are located on separate sides of the '''Royal Quarters''', and they can visit the player's [[Garden]] as [[The Garden#Visitors|Visitors]] after the player interacts with them. A {{NPCSprite|Castle Guard}} is also located here.

